# Quickstart

## 1) Validate your data

```cmd
arb validate --package docs-suite --data data.yaml
```

## 2) Compile outputs

```cmd
arb compile --package docs-suite --data data.yaml --out out
```

arb writes files into `out/`, preserving directory structure under `templates/`.

## 3) Iterate

Change:
- the data (safe, validated)
- the templates (presentation/structure)

Regenerate any time.
